// wandr.jellyfin — the client's non-UI contract. The Slint UI + canvas/input/
// frame-pacing come from slint_wandr::launch! (hermetic inline WIT); wasi:audio +
// wandr:video are imported by wandr-media-engine's OWN imports-only generate!, NOT
// here. So this world is the app's SECOND generate!/export!: it exports only
// wandr:background/background — the bg-tick that drives the headless engine (Jellyfin
// API + DirectPlay demux/decode + wasi:audio/wandr:video). Video PRESENT runs on the
// render path via slint_wandr::on_render_frame (host present clock), not bg-tick.
package wandr:jellyfin;

world jellyfin-extras {
    export wandr:background/background@0.1.0;
}
